    "CS2102 requires CS2040S (or CS2040/CS2040C/CS2040DE/CS2040HS) as a prerequisite. The student requires CS2040S before CS2103T, but CS2102 also requires CS2040S. Since CS2102 must be taken in Semester 1 (Y1S1), CS2040S must be completed before or in Semester 1. However, CS2040S requires CS1231S (or CS1231/MA1100/MA1100T) as a prerequisite. CS1231S cannot be completed before Semester 1. Therefore, CS2040S cannot be completed by the end of Semester 1, making it impossible to satisfy the prerequisite for CS2102 in Semester 1."
